# Line-ending policy (review H3).
#
# The tree had 53 CRLF files, 28 LF files and 5 files that were internally
# MIXED — and no attribute file. `git diff` therefore reported whole-file
# rewrites (markdown.ts: 252+/241- by default, 20+/9- with
# `--ignore-all-space`), which destroys the credibility of review and blame.
#
# `text=auto` + `eol=lf` normalises the index to LF; checkouts on Windows stay
# byte-identical to what the tests read. Binary artifacts are excluded
# explicitly so git never rewrites them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.tgz binary
